WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.300
Phone A shows its contact as an animated QR. Phone B scans it and saves the verified identity.

2
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:23.600
Then the other way round: now each phone has the other in its address book.

3
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:32.133
Phone A opens the chat and writes. The contact has a verified identity and a direct P2P link.

4
00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:38.133
Send: the message leaves phone A for phone B.

5
00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:45.333
Phone B, same moment: the message arrives about 2 seconds after sending. The notification does not show the text.

6
00:00:45.333 --> 00:01:02.633
Phone B opens the chat, reads and replies.

7
00:01:02.633 --> 00:01:10.133
Phone A gets the reply about 4 seconds after it was sent.
